# Pydantic AI in Pollack

Apply skill `.cursor/skills/pydantic-ai/SKILL.md` for architecture decisions.

## Repo rules

- Create agents via `make_agent()` / `make_ocr_agent()` in `agents/config.py`
- Structured extraction: `NativeOutput(PydanticModel)` + module-level agents
- Prefer multi-pass specialized agents over one mega-agent (`court/extract.py`)
- Orchestration stays in async Python; do not add LangGraph unless explicitly requested
- For toolsets, capabilities, hooks, or chat history — read skill reference before inventing patterns

## Build advice default

Recommend the simplest design that fits: stateless pipeline > tool loop > deferred capabilities.
